advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Sharpshooters}

Summons Sharpshooters to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Sharpshooters summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Sharpshooters.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Sharpshooters}

Summons Sharpshooters to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Sharpshooters summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Sharpshooters.
